                <pb facs="0158" n="98" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg98"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Denby</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Jernigan reports riot Kutien; American lady wounded. Ask instant protection.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
